--- target: The target string.
--- targetLength: The length of target, or -1 if null-terminated.
--- Returns: true if source is greater than target, false otherwise.
--- See: ucol_strcoll
--- See: ucol_greaterOrEqual
--- See: ucol_equal
--- @stable ICU 2.0
--- ffi:
